{"seq":1,"slug":"pyg-framework","title":"PyG 框架深入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/engineering/pyg-framework","wordCount":663,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"pyg-框架深入\">PyG 框架深入</h1><p>PyTorch Geometric（PyG）是 2026 年图神经网络的事实标准框架。NVIDIA 已将整个图 GPU 加速生态整合到 PyG 周围——RAPIDS 25.06 移除了 cuGraph-DGL，PhysicsNeMo 在 25.11 版默认使用 PyG，DGL 容器在 25.08 后停止支持。掌握 PyG 的核心抽象和高级特性，是每个 GNN 工程师的必备技能。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>PyG 构建在三个核心抽象之上：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[PyG 核心抽象] --&gt; B[Data / HeteroData]&#10;    A --&gt; C[MessagePassing]&#10;    A --&gt; D[DataLoader / Sampler]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[图结构: edge_index]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[节点特征: x]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[边特征: edge_attr]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[message 函数]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[aggregate 函数]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[update 函数]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[NeighborLoader]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[ClusterLoader]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[LinkNeighborLoader]\">graph TD\n    A[PyG 核心抽象] --&gt; B[Data / HeteroData]\n    A --&gt; C[MessagePassing]\n    A --&gt; D[DataLoader / Sampler]\n    B --&gt; B1[图结构: edge_index]\n    B --&gt; B2[节点特征: x]\n    B --&gt; B3[边特征: edge_attr]\n    C --&gt; C1[message 函数]\n    C --&gt; C2[aggregate 函数]\n    C --&gt; C3[update 函数]\n    D --&gt; D1[NeighborLoader]\n    D --&gt; D2[ClusterLoader]\n    D --&gt; D3[LinkNeighborLoader]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>抽象层</th>\n<th>核心类</th>\n<th>职责</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据表示</td>\n<td><code>Data</code>, <code>HeteroData</code>, <code>Batch</code></td>\n<td>存储图结构与特征</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>算子层</td>\n<td><code>MessagePassing</code>, 各种 <code>Conv</code></td>\n<td>定义消息传递计算</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据管线</td>\n<td><code>DataLoader</code>, <code>NeighborLoader</code></td>\n<td>采样与批处理</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>变换层</td>\n<td><code>Transforms</code></td>\n<td>图预处理与增强</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>解释层</td>\n<td><code>Explainer</code>, <code>ExplainerAlgorithm</code></td>\n<td>模型可解释性</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"messagepassing-基类详解\">MessagePassing 基类详解</h2><p>所有 PyG 的卷积算子都继承自 <code>MessagePassing</code>。自定义一个 GNN 层只需实现三个方法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch&#10;from torch_geometric.nn import MessagePassing&#10;from torch_geometric.utils import add_self_loops, softmax&#10;&#10;class CustomGATConv(MessagePassing):&#10;    def __init__(self, in_channels, out_channels, heads=1):&#10;        super().__init__(aggr=&#39;add&#39;, node_dim=0)&#10;        self.heads = heads&#10;        self.lin = torch.nn.Linear(in_channels, heads * out_channels, bias=False)&#10;        self.att = torch.nn.Parameter(torch.empty(1, heads, 2 * out_channels))&#10;        torch.nn.init.xavier_uniform_(self.att)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x, edge_index):&#10;        x = self.lin(x).view(-1, self.heads, self.out_channels)&#10;        return self.propagate(edge_index, x=x)&#10;&#10;    def message(self, x_i, x_j, index):&#10;        alpha = (torch.cat([x_i, x_j], dim=-1) * self.att).sum(dim=-1)&#10;        alpha = softmax(alpha, index)&#10;        return alpha.unsqueeze(-1) * x_j&#10;&#10;    def update(self, aggr_out):&#10;        return aggr_out.view(-1, self.heads * self.out_channels)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch_geometric.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> MessagePassing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch_geometric.utils </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> add_self_loops, softmax</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> CustomGATConv</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">MessagePassing</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, in_channels, out_channels, heads</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">aggr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'add'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">node_dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.heads </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> heads</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lin </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn.Linear(in_channels, heads </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> out_channels, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">bias</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">False</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.att </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.nn.Parameter(torch.empty(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, heads, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> out_channels))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        torch.nn.init.xavier_uniform_(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.att)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x, edge_index):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.lin(x).view(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.heads, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.out_channels)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.propagate(edge_index, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">x</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">x)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> message</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x_i, x_j, index):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (torch.cat([x_i, x_j], </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.att).sum(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dim</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        alpha </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> softmax(alpha, index)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> alpha.unsqueeze(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> x_j</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> update</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, aggr_out):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> aggr_out.view(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.heads </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.out_channels)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>propagate()</code> 方法自动处理消息的收集与聚合，开发者只需关注消息逻辑本身。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pyg-2-0-的异构图支持\">PyG 2.0 的异构图支持</h2><p>PyG 2.0 引入了 <code>HeteroData</code> 和 <code>to_hetero()</code> 两个关键 API，使得任意同质 GNN 可以零代码改动地应用于异构图：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from torch_geometric.data import HeteroData&#10;from torch_geometric.nn import SAGEConv, to_hetero&#10;&#10;data = HeteroData()&#10;data[&#39;paper&#39;].x = paper_features      # [num_papers, feat_dim]&#10;data[&#39;author&#39;].x = author_features    # [num_authors, feat_dim]&#10;data[&#39;paper&#39;, &#39;cites&#39;, &#39;paper&#39;].edge_index = cite_edges&#10;data[&#39;author&#39;, &#39;writes&#39;, &#39;paper&#39;].edge_index = write_edges&#10;&#10;class HomoGNN(torch.nn.Module):&#10;    def __init__(self, hidden):&#10;        super().__init__()&#10;        self.conv1 = SAGEConv((-1, -1), hidden)&#10;        self.conv2 = SAGEConv((-1, -1), hidden)&#10;&#10;    def forward(self, x, edge_index):&#10;        x = self.conv1(x, edge_index).relu()&#10;        return self.conv2(x, edge_index)&#10;&#10;model = HomoGNN(hidden=64)&#10;model = to_hetero(model, data.metadata(), aggr=&#39;sum&#39;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch_geometric.data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HeteroData</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch_geometric.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SAGEConv, to_hetero</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HeteroData()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'paper'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> paper_features      </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># [num_papers, feat_dim]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'author'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> author_features    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># [num_authors, feat_dim]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'paper'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'cites'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'paper'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].edge_index </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cite_edges</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'author'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'writes'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'paper'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].edge_index </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> write_edges</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">class</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> HomoGNN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">torch</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">nn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Module</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> __init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, hidden):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        super</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">().</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">__init__</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv1 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SAGEConv((</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), hidden)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv2 </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SAGEConv((</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), hidden)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> forward</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(self, x, edge_index):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        x </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv1(x, edge_index).relu()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> self</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.conv2(x, edge_index)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> HomoGNN(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">hidden</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> to_hetero(model, data.metadata(), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">aggr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'sum'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>to_hetero()</code> 自动为每种 (src_type, rel_type, dst_type) 三元组创建独立的参数组。</p>\n<h2 id=\"编译加速-torch_geometric-compile\">编译加速：torch_geometric.compile()</h2><p>PyG 2.3+ 引入了 <code>torch_geometric.compile()</code>，在 <code>torch.compile()</code> 基础上增加了 GNN 特定的优化：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化</th>\n<th>效果</th>\n<th>机制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>消除动态分发</td>\n<td>减少 graph breaks</td>\n<td>临时禁用 <code>MessagePassing</code> 的 Python 派发</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>scatter 融合</td>\n<td>减少内核启动</td>\n<td>将相邻 scatter 操作合并为一个内核</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>稀疏格式优化</td>\n<td>减少内存</td>\n<td>使用 CSR 替代 COO 存储 edge_index</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>在 MUTAG 基准上，编译后的 GIN 模型推理速度提升 2.3 倍，内存占用减少 40%。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import torch_geometric&#10;&#10;model = torch_geometric.compile(model, dynamic=True)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch_geometric</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch_geometric.compile(model, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dynamic</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">True</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"featurestore-与-graphstore\">FeatureStore 与 GraphStore</h2><p>对于无法完整载入 GPU 内存的大图，PyG 2.0 提供了可插拔的远程存储后端：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[训练循环] --&gt; B[NeighborLoader]&#10;    B --&gt; C[GraphStore]&#10;    B --&gt; D[FeatureStore]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[本地内存]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[远程 Redis/Memcached]&#10;    C --&gt; C3[分布式 Partition]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[本地 Tensor]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[远程 Feature Server]&#10;    D --&gt; D3[磁盘 Memory-Map]\">graph LR\n    A[训练循环] --&gt; B[NeighborLoader]\n    B --&gt; C[GraphStore]\n    B --&gt; D[FeatureStore]\n    C --&gt; C1[本地内存]\n    C --&gt; C2[远程 Redis/Memcached]\n    C --&gt; C3[分布式 Partition]\n    D --&gt; D1[本地 Tensor]\n    D --&gt; D2[远程 Feature Server]\n    D --&gt; D3[磁盘 Memory-Map]</pre><p><code>FeatureStore</code> 和 <code>GraphStore</code> 是抽象接口，底层可接入 Redis、Memcached、NVMe 或分布式系统。训练代码无需修改，只需替换 store 的实现。</p>\n<h2 id=\"完整训练管线示例\">完整训练管线示例</h2><p>一个工业级 GNN 训练管线的典型组成：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"from torch_geometric.loader import NeighborLoader&#10;from torch_geometric.nn import GraphSAGE&#10;&#10;# 1. 数据加载与采样&#10;train_loader = NeighborLoader(&#10;    data,&#10;    num_neighbors=[25, 10],&#10;    batch_size=1024,&#10;    input_nodes=train_mask,&#10;    num_workers=4,&#10;)&#10;&#10;# 2. 模型定义&#10;model = GraphSAGE(&#10;    in_channels=data.num_features,&#10;    hidden_channels=256,&#10;    num_layers=2,&#10;    out_channels=num_classes,&#10;)&#10;&#10;# 3. 训练循环&#10;optimizer = torch.optim.Adam(model.parameters(), lr=0.01)&#10;for batch in train_loader:&#10;    batch = batch.to(device)&#10;    out = model(batch.x, batch.edge_index)[:batch.batch_size]&#10;    loss = F.cross_entropy(out, batch.y[:batch.batch_size])&#10;    loss.backward()&#10;    optimizer.step()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch_geometric.loader </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NeighborLoader</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch_geometric.nn </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GraphSAGE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 1. 数据加载与采样</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">train_loader </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> NeighborLoader(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    data,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_neighbors</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">25</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    batch_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1024</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    input_nodes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">train_mask,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_workers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 2. 模型定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">model </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GraphSAGE(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    in_channels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">data.num_features,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    hidden_channels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">256</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    num_layers</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">    out_channels</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">num_classes,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 3. 训练循环</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">optimizer </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> torch.optim.Adam(model.parameters(), </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0.01</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> train_loader:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    batch </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch.to(device)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    out </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> model(batch.x, batch.edge_index)[:batch.batch_size]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    loss </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> F.cross_entropy(out, batch.y[:batch.batch_size])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    loss.backward()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    optimizer.step()</span></span></code></pre></div><p>注意 <code>[:batch.batch_size]</code> 的截取——<code>NeighborLoader</code> 返回的 batch 包含了目标节点及其采样邻域，但只有前 <code>batch_size</code> 个是目标节点。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>PyG 是 2026 年 GNN 的事实标准，NVIDIA 已全面转向 PyG 生态</li>\n<li><code>MessagePassing</code> 基类通过 propagate/message/aggregate/update 提供统一的开发模式</li>\n<li><code>to_hetero()</code> 零代码将同质 GNN 转换为异构版本</li>\n<li><code>torch_geometric.compile()</code> 提供 GNN 特定的编译加速</li>\n<li><code>FeatureStore/GraphStore</code> 支持大图的远程/分布式存储</li>\n<li>PyG 2.0 的 GNN+LLM 集成通过 <code>torch_geometric.nn.nlp</code> 模块实现</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>同章节：<a href=\"scalable-gnn-training\">大规模 GNN 训练</a>详解 mini-batch 采样策略和多 GPU 并行方案</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../../network-graph-analysis/practice/tools-libraries\">网络与图分析 - 工具与库</a>对比了 NetworkX、igraph 等传统图分析库与 PyG 的定位差异</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"PyG 框架深入","id":"pyg-框架深入"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"MessagePassing 基类详解","id":"messagepassing-基类详解"},{"level":2,"text":"PyG 2.0 的异构图支持","id":"pyg-2-0-的异构图支持"},{"level":2,"text":"编译加速：torch_geometric.compile()","id":"编译加速-torch_geometric-compile"},{"level":2,"text":"FeatureStore 与 GraphStore","id":"featurestore-与-graphstore"},{"level":2,"text":"完整训练管线示例","id":"完整训练管线示例"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"社交网络与欺诈检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/applications/social-network-fraud-detection"},"next":{"title":"大规模图神经网络训练","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/graph-neural-networks/engineering/scalable-gnn-training"}}